abstract: >
  This release provides a merged forward/backward super-droplet tracking
  implementation for SCALE-SDM, including Two-Pass Hybrid Tracking (TPHT)
  for interest-restricted backward reconstruction and the GMD2026
  shallow-cloud benchmark and analysis workflow.
keywords:
  - "SCALE-SDM"
  - "super-droplet method"
  - "forward tracking"
  - "backward tracking"
  - "TPHT"
  - "cloud microphysics"
